<title>USA: Clinton arrives for Denver summit.</title>
<headline>Clinton arrives for Denver summit.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton arrived in Denver on Thursday to play host at a summit of leading industrialized nations.</p>
<p>He was due to deliver a speech outlining his goals at the summit of the Group of Seven -- United States, Japan, Germany, Italy, France, Britain and Canada, with the additional participation of Russia's President Boris Yeltsin.</p>
</text>
